[00:20.06]1. Beauty fills the earth,
[00:23.13]wonder fills our mind—
[00:25.93]The work of your hands
[00:28.73]so patiently designed.
[00:31.53]Though the world may change,
[00:34.33]you remain the same.
[00:37.57]You patiently wait
[00:40.80]to make it new again.
[00:45.30](Chorus)
[00:49.80]Father, we long to see
[00:53.80]Paradise come to be.
[00:58.84]Give us the patience to wait.
[01:04.84]We know your day will come,
[01:08.84]sure as the rising sun.
[01:13.84]No matter how long it takes,
[01:20.73]“It will not be late!”
[01:30.72]2. Faithfully we wait
[01:34.22]for the dead to rise.
[01:37.72]Jehovah, you yearn
[01:41.22]to bring them back to life.
[01:45.69]Father, we well know
[01:48.33]how you loved them so.
[01:50.97]Instill in our hearts
[01:56.44]the patience you have shown.
[01:58.94](Chorus)
[02:01.44]Father, we long to see
[02:05.44]Paradise come to be.
[02:09.44]Give us the patience to wait.
[02:14.16]We know your day will come,
[02:19.65]sure as the rising sun.
[02:25.14]No matter how long it takes,
[02:31.96]“It will not be late!”
[02:42.62]3. Patiently you search;
[02:44.49]honest hearts you find.
[02:46.36]You heal them with hope
[02:53.18]and long to give them life.
[03:00.18]Working by your side,
[03:02.51]sharing what is true,
[03:04.85]We use our time well.
[03:07.18]It draws us close to you.
[03:12.86](Chorus)
[03:15.46]Father, we long to see
[03:18.06]Paradise come to be.
[03:21.50]Give us the patience to wait.
[03:27.50]We know your day will come,
[03:31.50]sure as the rising sun.
[03:36.50]No matter how long it takes,
[03:43.50]“It will not be late!”
[03:53.37]Father, please help us to wait!